 succeeded in 0ms:
lrwxr-xr-x@ 1 nikolaosvasiloglou  staff  95 Nov  7 12:49 .venv/bin/python -> <home>/.local/share/uv/python/cpython-3.14-macos-aarch64-none/bin/python3.14
